 SIT {
  coords 575.417 17.229 851.644
  m_sTitle "Situation"
  m_sTextData "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
  "<b>DTL:</b> 01/08/2024, 0600hrs, Zarichne, Chernarus."\
  "<b>Weather:</b> Overcast, visibility 1km+, with a forecast of changing conditions."\
  ""\
  "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
  "Russia and Chernarus have been engaged in a large-scale conflict for the past two years, with fighting continuing across the country and along the front lines."\
  ""\
  "Throughout July, Chernarus Defence Forces have conducted a series of offensive operations against Russian positions in an effort to disrupt their presence and weaken their ability to operate throughout the region."\
  ""\
  "Zarichne has now become the focus of another operation. A Russian trench system on the outskirts of the a town, running along the Zherebets River, has been identified as a key defensive position supporting Russian operations in the area."\
  ""\
  "With both sides now committed to the area, fighting is expected to develop around the trench system and the nearby Russian headquarters. The outcome of the engagement could determine who maintains control of this section of Zarichne and the surrounding river line."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "GC_CDF"
  }
  m_iOrder 1
 }
 FF {
  coords 575.417 17.229 851.644
  m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
  m_sTextData "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
  "Our unit is a strike team from the Chernarus Defence Force (CDF), Raven SOF Company, consisting of 23 personnel. We are currently located at our boat dismount point along the Zherebets River."\
  ""\
  "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
  "• We have two Mavic drone with17x VOG-25 impact grenades, with 3 spare batteries stored in the equipment box beside HQ's boat."\
  "• All personnel are equipped with long-range optics."\
  ""\
  "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
  "• None."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "GC_CDF"
  }
  m_iOrder 3
 }
 MIS {
  coords 575.417 17.229 851.644
  m_sTitle "Mission"
  m_sTextData "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>  "\
  "Conduct a <b>DELIBERATE ASSAULT</b> to <b>OCCUPY & SECURE</b> the Russian HQ bunker."\
  ""\
  "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
  "Russian forces have established a fortified defensive position along the Zherebets River to control the flow of water movements and crossings, centred around a subterranean concrete bunker serving as their local HQ. Following artillery strikes against the outer trench positions, the initial guard presence near our dismount point has withdrawn back to the main trench once they saw us coming."\
  ""\
  "We are to assault through the remaining Russian defences, clear the surrounding trench network, and <b>OCCUPY & SECURE</b> the HQ bunker. Expect determined resistance from the remaining Russian forces defending the position."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "GC_CDF"
  }
  m_iOrder 4
 }
 EF {
  coords 575.417 17.229 851.644
  m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
  m_sTextData "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
  "This area contains approximately a platoon or more of Russian infantry from the <b>2nd Motor Rifle Platoon, 1st Motor Rifle Company</b>. Russian forces are dug into a network of trenches containing several fighting positions and bunkers."\
  "The main enemy position is centred around a subterranean concrete bunker, which serves as the Russian HQ for the area."\
  ""\
  "The initial trench position near our dismount point has been abandoned by the light guard presence following preparatory artillery strikes against the position."\
  ""\
  "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
  "• Well-established defensive positions consisting of trenches, bunkers, and fortified fighting positions."\
  "• An NSV heavy machine gun provides significant firepower and coverage over the surrounding area. Reference the marker for its location."\
  "• The subterranean HQ provides a hardened position and is expected to be the centre of enemy operations."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "GC_CDF"
  }
  m_iOrder 2
 }
}